for (const [bx,by,bz] of roots.values()) { ... box clear y by..by+10 ... }
```
Need avoid clearing terrain logs far below if sy-8; okay. If the spawn is at ground and tree base below (tree downhill), scanning down up to 8 finds.
Box clears logs and leaves only; plants remain.
If a trunk is at d=2 directly in front, removed. Good.

FindCoastSpawn:
- clearance check solid.
- Replace blocked sightline nonsense with real check:
```
const dx=(wcX-x), dz=..., len=hypot; const fx=dx/len, fz=dz/len;
